    "text": "Studio\nServices\nUpdates\nLatest updates\nView all\nConnected to Create: Designing with Culture, Not Just for It\nOpinion\nStudio Partnerships: Why Growing Together Makes Sense\nOpinion\nIntuitive Design: The Balance Between Data and Creativity\nOpinion\nWork\nStart Project\nLet’s create Better Interactions. Together with the world’s most detail-obsessed brands, we shape new standards for digital products and experiences.\nFeatured Cases\nSyte\n\nSyte empowers project developers, investors, agents, architects and city planners to spot interesting properties with development potential.\n\n\nPleo\n\nWe worked with Pleo to create an extensive icon system that truly expresses its vibrant and quirky character.\n\n\nView Case Study\nRegpit\n\nCreating the world’s most intuitive anti-money laundering app, designed to effectively serve a global audience\n\nClients\nWe work internationally with a wide range of clients, shaping better futures by turning good ideas into great experiences.\nView all projects\nWho We Are\n\nAt Studio Lenzing, we are all about people. This is why we put collaboration and open dialogue at the heart of our work.\n\nWe create partnerships at eye-level, working hand in hand for digital change.\n\nMore about us\nServices\nUser Experience\n\nUser Insights\nUX Audit\nFocus Groups\nUsability Testing\nAffinity Diagramming\n\nUX Strategy\n\nUser Journeys\nBrand Strategy\nInformation Architecture\nBrand Principles\n\nInteractive Design\n\nUI Design\nUX Design\nMotion Design\nPrototyping\n\nProduction\n\nDesign Systems\nDesign Libraries\nDev Documentations\nLottie animations\n\nStart Project\n\nLet's create something unique together. Complete the questionnaire and we will be in touch shortly.\n\nLet’s work together\nStudio\nWork\nStudio Lenzing is an interactive design studio focused on crafting better experiences for brands and for people.\nJOBS\nPRICING\nCOLOPHON\nPRINCIPLES\nNEWSLETTER\nINSTAGRAM\nREAD.CV\nTWITTER\nSPOTIFY\n18:47:38 local time\n\nHamburg & Barcelona\nWorking internationally\n\nhi@studiolenzing.com\nContact\nStart project\n© 2026 Studio Lenzing\nPrivacy policy\nImprint",
